, "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-24T11:55:58Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "Basically the idea is that when you wet the ball, the leather absorbs the moisture, so it makes the ball heavier", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-24T11:56:05Z", "username": "Kartikey Pradhan", "text": "That’s what she said", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-24T11:56:18Z", "username": "Sidhesh K K", "text": "Paseena ho ya thoonk....\nSannu hai bas jeet di bhoonk", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-24T11:56:23Z", "username": "Kartikey Pradhan", "text": "Main khud ke statements par hi bolne laga hun ab", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-24T11:56:26Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "But wetting can also wet the seam underneath ie the secondary seam, making the ridges more prominent", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-24T11:56:38Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "Which can make reverse swing easier in theory", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-24T11:56:46Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "But most likely the wetting just makes the surface softer", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-24T11:56:55Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "So you can scratch or gouge it to make it rougher", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-24T11:57:17Z", "username": "Kartikey Pradhan", "text": "It’s also relative right? You either smoothen one side out, or make the other one coarser", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"